  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8c4a5e4c01d506cf47dab3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是带来神圣光芒的力量。净化邪恶、\n拯救世界的光辉，下一场赛事也请继续见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3860ce0c6f9910a12fa07e43037b360b971385ff7dbd38f33dbbe426e688d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1579"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6e15578032f60f66c197df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我看到了令人想就那样不断跑下去……\\n既新奇又亮眼的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45905bf071364d583207bb63c38e480c4e24fed2e92706a438f38273fbe7cd99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f933f33d7f74524274296971",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226bc07ad7824cd810a13de4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df1af109ba05f3400346690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646d8c1264de5c594a532559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1583"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc60832c1b51b50d45afe5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1584"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc29c70eb0f4ecd4f51f854",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1585"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72090f476d72bd44ef58c0a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e53ff9bf34d5cd9e298db6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1587"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce6b15d16cd1c081b6dee54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1588"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d15b4294c823ef3a5ab74f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1589"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1ce4af66942e117ec76e2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是让其他人全都相形失色的……\\n没事！会长在瞪我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270e204e99cb67ed9dc1858ea7d609d62ca2cf91a2dfbf7d5e01fb3e5fd941ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b04e9ee3fc8136d782cd2f11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了让心情平静下来，想去植物园……。\n触碰到泥土的香气——就会被治愈呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc3d6fcd7bc7456b49e2c61b086da740675d59700f6bdab41772b3f35c8a261",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1590"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a709e3333f37cdd4587b593",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了能将胜利的一朵鲜花——交到您手上……。\n我会去挑战的。带着坚定的——必胜的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f489c4d0f390d42dc333e33bd9de27b090a36d70631f72688feef7ad84d08fe6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1f4abdcbd8bb8c34a465f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e301e315a321142aee2d11f76082e569e477296be2ea955afd1282d2bd06f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc944c7a7e87fb6f3bc2bf6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了事前的——训练员的，指导。\n感觉就像是我们在共同奔跑一样……令人非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2553cbc83861206e70e438c3fe9194b69bd357b1a984861f0681b6b6ebf6161f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1593"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f708f88c556f4b5f02b67e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和青梅竹马一起吃了——很『可爱』的松饼。\n食用花，真的很招人喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21160e0df0ce093fcc724658f5daec8b6fa28e5bef6ebfa11f6f4e083072e2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1594"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970771ed9d2eb4849099003a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e301e315a321142aee2d11f76082e569e477296be2ea955afd1282d2bd06f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1595"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe1d717d4be5ca8ab6a58af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了事前的——训练员的，指导。\n感觉就像是我们在共同奔跑一样……令人非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2553cbc83861206e70e438c3fe9194b69bd357b1a984861f0681b6b6ebf6161f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1596"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed380b6d1dceac2485d4a54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和青梅竹马一起吃了——很『可爱』的松饼。\n食用花，真的很招人喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21160e0df0ce093fcc724658f5daec8b6fa28e5bef6ebfa11f6f4e083072e2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1597"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f60566512e8b0771c10c73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉就像是，看到了——月下美人的开花。\n喜出望外。能去挑战，真是太好了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f527c0aabf4b005eb13fa5093a37e11d810b421f7b21acd88e715598c3808014",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1598"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8f0d119282f6d4a1a0e8c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是能带回一朵足以献给训练员伟大功绩的——\n充满价值的胜利之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5681f4f182c99d7f4e13d11807e56022db6257728aa67e14a958238b350032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1599"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03085cda380e1e3b82c34708",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像是并跑练习和比拚耐力……\\n呃，为什么脑中浮现的都是那家伙啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd88ede45868425ec9557b2ac2fdc522c6d54db5917ed1df896d7fdfb0cf321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4aad7e250340043863ebdf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错，这只不过是其中的一页！\\n这位记者说得很好～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b1042e0956ad510e4455e3797197deee702b18031ebaea1915189dae0d68e0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a5177430b9247d4bb1bcc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉就像是，看到了——月下美人的开花。\n喜出望外。能去挑战，真是太好了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f527c0aabf4b005eb13fa5093a37e11d810b421f7b21acd88e715598c3808014",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30a5daa5884d311ba357615",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是能带回一朵足以献给训练员伟大功绩的——\n充满价值的胜利之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5681f4f182c99d7f4e13d11807e56022db6257728aa67e14a958238b350032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8329bb5c548286e5f05fc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要赢过在场所有的赛马娘，\\n证明能拿下优胜的「绝对会是我」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc57e54dd4aca2bf32012609b4808ce0b77a4dc6f2ea84c46d7893b4b373ab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbee6dcbefbb808f4f1acae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耀眼！努力不懈的小妹妹们都好可爱，\\n让姐姐我感到很温馨呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcb7a55352268769ae842d80016583650794ea1f28e487dab0a45dbc3fa2d8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1e160908b290698054b860",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是「泡沫乐园」♪只要有买年票的话，\\n就随时都能在度假村里狂欢啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56a7f5b47fbc4a16c2d51e198154d4beeef789c460cc2256fed74de97195915",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14141cd35b5bd2c5d5664d94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是玩一款叫「胡萝卜吉」的养成游戏喔♪\\n我已经被泡沫吉给迷得神魂颠倒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c4b25710998bdbc99b6471b52589af58615f73415670a57aebdbc88e93f3a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0abb4412e3e61e6705dbaf83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道呢？如果你只一直注视着我的话，\\n或许就会知道啰……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bad7a161d845f883fef2bb8f2b5e2d753fb963a85b83c72cdf8ae971bf9a54d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920139b3dc827a5a5b514d69",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来约定吧！我下次也会用自己的表现\\n来让大家见证「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455c6a3d2a5019c4f49f36e0629d315fa3566ed79246855faff82e1c0e0fd1ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59bf8cab3c30ce5ec8cff099",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！能让你们像这样用闪闪发亮的眼睛\\n看着我，对我而言就是最大的鼓励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87072a879008054ca9c155f58113e67b2a1f86e3873d0b55161cb79c739e7fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd3afff16da63c1536c3b3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃得饱饱的」……这好像跟平时没两样……\\n到下次比赛前，先让我想一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02203931f5e2e6e67a6e344e7c77348baebfad1ce877d9ad6ea3ee4e836ea029",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:253de447f1de5ed1dca4f66f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我自己是不太清楚……但我跑步时的表情\\n难道真的那么恐怖吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7c7a36321f6eea952ea33476bfcf78de8b797d42b90c3c4f5e2c38f82daee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c9083b5764f522ca85531d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是……非常值得尊敬，除了\\n独一无二的恩师之外没有其他词汇可以形容♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a612f3ed0d21c9dfdc382061df5c41137f0177f810af78bbd03a3a15eae1a6a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00965f68c5842780984caf0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的声援总是能给我许多帮助……\\n希望大家今后也能一直看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096107e5ed0a8e0f1b56cec923c866fbc21a992aa490f07a8b5d844474013732",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbb3fee02d3f221ba0f6580",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海鳗……不对，是虎鲸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560a312c6b949572e17485b3662fc7d8e530f9b59c72ca141a35dc33efac4d8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e1fc2503a10b575263bdf47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我为了要在训练员脸上乱涂鸦，就把\\n墨水换成了墨汁啰。应该是因为这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c526cd60a3bdd0976a1ced052d297a62c310f00a87d08b4daadff3bcd514eac1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa33adfed9ce0f7ae18184d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙马上就塞了一堆训练过来。\\n应该要一边看着棋谱一边进行五组PK赛才对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83eec9633d3b6585425b7498d7e979c849664e52de41a3333c68e1d03f137f03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5856a3057d31c6b16c26d8f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然我很想说……竞赛对我而言全都一样，\\n但还是……唔唔～我要加油──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bc7cdff39e28257b6791a0b148904b4cd492f7cf619379c22b1f8813845b7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:201b8b0c81e590f1b8534f3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我一直都很────拼命地去比赛，\\n所以根本就没时间去觉得辛苦呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35652432399ae4c4ade49447dfad56ebf4be22767aea04d9732169c75c320f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54ff336a239a5dc5f9a1b7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是还没有啦……但感觉之后应该会郑重地\\n来跟我说一些……让人感到害臊的话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1519203fb951e49b04efeb376d220752aba247aebb26f5aae507e88d7210cab3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334ecac96f3b577d76cffb6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸能与那样的对手们较劲。\\n我会抱着虚心求教的态度下场比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fdf4ad8f83e84ac8bed2eaa029c79db7881a5b11daabc7cf152b796ab3e50a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32597251cc88b6308295f9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在小地方发生了明显的失误……\\n不过，我一定会在决赛之前改进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae9670591b59a42f2e969f29d9dae7245b6a7aad3a432afd3395c568569343",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c3c3e96cc86195e4973824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本想尝试看看脚步轻盈的跑法，但最后\\n还是决定采用力道强劲的风格去比赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "250ff92e7fcc49a338b332010e2cb0db3a231d8fe7a6dfe4734547bfd2a1a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e79035ee1a47fe57eddb10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想向粉丝、工作人员以及训练员……\\n想向所有人表达感谢之意♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e97a4af4760ab5e72e6811e09f91731a0e44635f1345e356f52fb00caa6d10cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f1257d5055aa175c15b6da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位有享受到美式规格的竞赛了吗？\\n我在决赛时会拿出世界级的表现喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1fe40538a0402dee2066ff3551bfab79fb21afe2d9946164a8d5a084c07e7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38603f6e0cbeb85de232809a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Good harvest！\\n现在的我感觉能在各种竞赛中获胜喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "682d030ff3c6a9b649087dbda1f11be7aa28d75ccb4f55dcda9014f7767261ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e85bd789bd1c48f22ae9df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在模拟竞赛时的情况！\\n我要做的只有相信他而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfe9944fa34e74ff8dce30b407e007e4acedcf5b2399e516764bf0ba85a97e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f36ed531d04f827246eb7da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竭尽全力与强敌激烈竞争的兴奋感，\\n实在是无可取代呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e125515d1b618a7884a6a933843fec883c798db266d567614cd6ff1770040d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51228f722472bad4b3e25e9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是要先把手机桌布上的目标竞赛日期\\n换成决赛的日期吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8828d1a87ac6cb3ae99ec15b1e3c91e3e2644af6e87a51610b9d89982bbaeed1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79b6135ffb0292b0a8db07d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "俗话说「胜不骄，败不馁」。\\n我想继续精进自己，不会让自己松懈下来喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "001f21bb06e4817b3c07363478d1ac204c575de5b5ff45d418e5c505f6523e26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5686871e6d6fdac9d4237afb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正合我意！不这样的话比赛就不有趣了！\\n不论对手是谁我都要用单挑一较高下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bb9c52fbc28d64d75386daf019dfebd9cfae20aaab20fb0d33b2711ff857017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3b3939e1dde6f640622988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是最常见的炸猪排吧。\\n好，来帮队伍里的所有人各做一份！",
      "source_fingerprint": "990f4ddd0e859226646a1f4eef62f8888bc21aa8823727a78af04d2b81601977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12228626ad3fe894a73bf828",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会出赛的应该都是很猛的家伙吧……\\n一想到这里，我就期待到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b835210cf897e1269855f5d5790c92f68060dc24220c2066f8bef96a13172b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d579467b968d05abcf6cc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是双脚的保养吧。为了不要让自己受伤，\\n我也从生野那里获得了很多建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7703191ad3f1ceddf22b60b2b9c60d4fbfc20ccddf91c2dce61e82949768d1e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aafb0cd0b89f536602c1edfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "重点是要有想象力。从起跑开始前，\\n就锁定终点然后……BANG！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a6dba87ebaa2a77ea24543e307b02c9c9eeefe43377e5536a95c3fb53db42e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be82636e8aae790a20460e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不能失去冷静，要保持自己的步调。\\n多亏这样我才能在竞赛中顺利发挥出了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5165a6dda06287c48cd2d4876cf196268466fc154d5c1d90566bff6eb60bafdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f619530cf3162abc5623c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊。不过我没有丝毫要退却的打算。\\n因为我会在准备万全且状态绝佳之下去挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd961f6f6065f6b8e6a943e65fab077ae718410f2071894bba435908ebde634",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf8a705a2122b92baa8f8bfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "No──！！唯独这件事，不管给我\\n多少墨西哥卷饼都还是No！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f27bda8c972be85a520dcb7155ad364b8a85169ed93b4b3fc04b16239b85c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f657e1ea10304327ab53982f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "神鹰我还没有拿出真本事！接下来还会\\n推出更加认真的表演给大家欣赏喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b002fa6484cd4c1fdc666cca12555fb8599b76080e8acef2aee1657f21907126",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f6c41d90312d0cb2466b44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～不过最热血的还是神鹰我的热情！\\n可要小心别被烫伤喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c73ce785b1bd59339fa14d3c39d58d2054da1e1e53f9a025fbcb51ada3de70a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9274222d7ffb069a2d96cf39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是由火腿、秋葵、乌龙面搭配在一起的\\n致胜料理「霸王」套餐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b408f537f13ac29d86ce4f4f24016c64ac1d9509a0f20ca068327e24f5b0dd01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bb4d2812e0c8e5448c67df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是要留意弹性速度以免过于单调这点。\\n然后将普契尼放在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "116c02ba0aee2e916d6211bc1efa07ae19125bf58bba72c15ac319c57f1ec7cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68afc949e1902091c4b365fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来大家都畏惧着我的才华！原谅我……\\n因为连我自己都无法抑制那份才华呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da5ea9c319afa064068a03c0c748189adad8395479b094f628f19e72c1b9e23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5087e9db3d37c8725bdbe0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猛禽吗……挺不错的比喻。不管是我，\\n还是其他人，都只是为了生存而寻求着猎物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6633d98f105fa444a74ec16818358e084a47bb8adaf9ad8e155b8d5c1cb54daf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d711dcfd431843a9b00b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……说不期待是骗人的。不过，\\n无论对手是谁，我都一样会拿出全力去狩猎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6720f731e137f80affb146ced2de10d0df3b02f09362b1a89d8f9a2ba3c2ba78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf526f0ace410dec27f9f76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我投入到脑中一片空白！\\n等回过神来已经是第1名……现在非常开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c1e521746a8d4e372c0fcdc01c5822ca8c1b8832812b202f2439dfa5ae3e95",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa7d76e2c3e5af9744f18fe4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃饭、睡觉、玩乐！\\n嗯……似乎跟平常没有两样耶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "874ecd82b468ada61358414a603506f5ba5558cf8f9b688b387b2ae6350dbe58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c759ce30c75c5a260a72b40c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不在乎。就依你们在看了我的表现之后\\n所感受到的那样，想怎么称呼我都行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e64a6ca03bf6e04cc643c5ae1a5c072755a11b0ed124545e7aeb59493cd3e86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e51c18712e413839216e0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一阵清爽……激战结束之时可是风平浪静呢。\\n这就是所谓的暴风雨前的宁静吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a99555441d8b04abe19d85480252d9528449275684756971aad5f0824f960b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80db4936c045833e98718db3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家都是「关」不「住」求胜心的强敌。\\n那是理所……呵……不好意思，呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05d2f2a2a2f378b3595f637e98fff78d903912af02dd83bc4bda206be550c40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c95dade193834c3506bcf4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是「决心」。但并非不被容许败北，\\n而是要有不容许自己败北的决心方能成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef822718f39cc1a9d4a992b5bbd4f38aa14033a4eaa79bf18b542b9709c28f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce013b35072d7e5727a1e3f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不负「女帝」之名并完全压制他人的表现，\\n或许偶尔会让人有那种感觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6b3c1fd6117450d44d9ff9d664d9a930123e3e07fdde8b3abb9e59702dcb480",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e9e2d2fd108ced92ea01dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我是带着「必须如此」的想法去比赛的。\\n能听见你这样说表示我合格了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2239f0c029eaaef009cf1f0ec0949b1a13ede69241c58b550e304afd66f8878a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360c99809e5f58b436bbc80d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为今天的结果是彼此互相拼命得来的……\\n所以我要基于这个理由表示感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e12803937531c745e1827d6c041131966d42feb206dbfc1bab17f91a7b551f2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a15c79097a94de21971dd70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我每天都会一边从头到脚将竞赛对手\\n瞻仰个仔细，一边尽全力去奔跑喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5687670b323bec10a5aae3e25781aef976e6f23fc9c64bf4316f3040a69a15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6281d9f1bb0dcd4cbbf268d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会多做功德直到竞赛开始前！！\\n这让我不管遇上什么状况都能保持冷静！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8e93c8ffa8874f2b63e0448972501cc15d0a458bfcf9fcd8f048ca167a4136",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "208"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
